   "p": "Look at what was opened, read, eaten and drunk: <span class='ar nasb'>الْبَابَ</span>, <span class='ar nasb'>الدَّرْسَ</span>, <span class='ar nasb'>خُبْزًا</span>, <span class='ar nasb'>الشَّايَ</span>. They all end in <strong>fatḥa</strong>. The thing the action happens to is the <em>mafʿūl bihi</em> (object), and it is <em>manṣūb</em>."
